{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom has fallen. Cursed beasts now roam the land, and only you can turn the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fantasy tower defense game, rebuild your shattered kingdom and lead the fight against an overwhelming horde of corrupted animals. Construct powerful towers, master devastating spells, and uncover the mysteries behind the world's downfall.<br>Ancient secrets lie buried in the ruins, expand your reach,  uncover hidden mysteries, lost knowledge, and the dark origins of the curse itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Classic tower defense gameplay set in a rich fantasy world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0 18 towers, each with 15 unique upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Explore and reclaim lost lands and push back the corruption spreading across the realm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9 Cast a wide range of magical spells to freeze, burn, or electrify your enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Uncover mysteries and ancient secrets hidden across the land</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Combine strategic tower placement with powerful spellcasting for tactical mastery</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3862950?t=1762519566","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862950/dbd58f01ea6ec075ecd92f1dbf25aa8ed3bccebd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762519566","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862950/10e09200b76a42d1bdc8fe844b0cec3ef905a576/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762519566","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862950/10e09200b76a42d1bdc8fe844b0cec3ef905a576/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762519566","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera